Subject: [PATCH] Add 'when' reactions (v0.3)

'when condition' + block runs the block each time the condition goes
from false to true. Conditions are checked after every assignment; all
whens observe the same moment, then rising ones fire in order. Already
true at declaration fires immediately. Blocks may change values and
cascade, with a 100-deep loop limit. Missing names mean "not true yet";
a when still waiting at program end is reported as an error.

Also: fix docs/HANDOFF.md (contained another project's handoff),
README section and example, version 0.3.0-dev, 14 new tests.

